{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "WEBSTER1833",
  "book_code": "1TH",
  "chapter": 5,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "1TH.5.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1TH.5.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But of the times and the seasons, brethren, ye have no need that I write to you.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "1TH.5.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1TH.5.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For yourselves know perfectly that the day of the Lord so cometh as a thief in the night.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1TH.5.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1TH.5.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For when they shall say, Peace and safety; then sudden destruction cometh upon them, as travail upon a woman with child; and they shall not escape.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1TH.5.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1TH.5.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But ye, brethren, are not in darkness, that that day should overtake you as a thief.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1TH.5.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1TH.5.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Ye are all children of light, and children of the day: we are not of the night, nor of darkness.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1TH.5.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1TH.5.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Therefore let us not sleep, as ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "do",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " others; but let us watch and be sober.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1TH.5.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1TH.5.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For they that sleep, sleep in the night; and they that are drunken, are drunken in the night.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1TH.5.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1TH.5.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But let us, who are of the day, be sober, putting on the breast-plate of faith and love; and for a helmet, the hope of salvation.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1TH.5.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1TH.5.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For God hath not appointed us to wrath, but to obtain salvation by our Lord Jesus Christ,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1TH.5.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1TH.5.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Who died for us, that, whether we wake or sleep, we should live together with him.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1TH.5.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1TH.5.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Wherefore, comfort yourselves together, and edify one another, even as also ye do.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1TH.5.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1TH.5.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And we beseech you, brethren, to know them who labor among you, and are over you in the Lord, and admonish you;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1TH.5.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1TH.5.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And to esteem them very highly in love for their work's sake. ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "And",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " be at peace among yourselves.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1TH.5.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1TH.5.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Now we exhort you, brethren, warn them that are disorderly, comfort the feeble-minded, support the weak, be patient towards all ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "men",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1TH.5.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1TH.5.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "See that none render evil for evil to any ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "man",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": "; but ever follow that which is good, both among yourselves, and to all ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "men",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1TH.5.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1TH.5.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Rejoice evermore.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1TH.5.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1TH.5.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Pray without ceasing.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1TH.5.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1TH.5.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "In every thing give thanks: for this is the will of God in Christ Jesus concerning you.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1TH.5.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1TH.5.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Quench not the spirit.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1TH.5.20",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1TH.5.20",
      "verse": 20,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Despise not prophesyings.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1TH.5.21",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1TH.5.21",
      "verse": 21,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Prove all things; hold fast that which is good.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1TH.5.22",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1TH.5.22",
      "verse": 22,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Abstain from all appearance of evil.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1TH.5.23",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1TH.5.23",
      "verse": 23,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the very God of peace sanctify you wholly; and ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "I pray God",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " your whole spirit and soul and body may be preserved blameless to the coming of our Lord Jesus Christ.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1TH.5.24",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1TH.5.24",
      "verse": 24,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Faithful ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " he that calleth you, who also will do ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "it",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1TH.5.25",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1TH.5.25",
      "verse": 25,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Brethren, pray for us.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1TH.5.26",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1TH.5.26",
      "verse": 26,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Greet all the brethren with a holy kiss.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1TH.5.27",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1TH.5.27",
      "verse": 27,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I charge you by the Lord that this epistle be read to all the holy brethren.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1TH.5.28",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1TH.5.28",
      "verse": 28,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The grace of our Lord Jesus Christ ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "be",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " with you. Amen.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    }
  ]
}
